Because the shop owner doesn't know how much chili you can eat.

136
00:08:04,733 --> 00:08:07,233
也许你是四川人呢
yěxǔ nǐ shì sìchuān rén ne
Perhaps you are from Sichuan?

137
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:10,733
四川人很能吃辣
sìchuān rén hěn néng chī là
Sichuan people can eat a lot of spicy food.

138
00:08:11,533 --> 00:08:16,933
像这样奇怪的差评在外卖APP有很多
xiàng zhèyàng qíguài de chàpíng zài wàimài APP yǒu hěnduō
There are many strange negative reviews like these on food delivery apps.

139
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:21,833
下一次我们还会说更奇怪的评价
xià yícì wǒmen hái huì shuō gèng qíguài de píngjià
Next time we'll make even stranger comments.

140
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,266
法官们你们准备好了吗
fǎguān men nǐmen zhǔnbèi hǎole ma
Judges, are you ready?

141
00:08:26,266 --> 00:08:28,600
今天我们就说到这里啦
jīntiān wǒmen jiù shuō dào zhèlǐ la
That's all for today!

142
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:30,133
